WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.920
Okay, we're diving deep into the season.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.120
This is where fatigue can set in.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.720
A championship season isn't won by the team that starts the fastest.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.320
It's won by the team that can sustain its performance.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.839
This lesson is all about the science of

00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:33.440
sustainable high performance for you and your team.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.100
In our next video, we'll begin by focusing on the most valuable resource you have as

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.600
a leader, your energy.
